[WHAT]
Add KUnit coverage for the EDID parsing helpers edid_extract_panel_id,
apply_edid_quirks and dm_helpers_parse_edid_caps, together with the
ACPI/VBIOS EDID readers dm_helpers_probe_acpi_edid,
